I'm assuming a generic product, since I don't know what it does. The optimizer is told not to invent features and to use placeholders like `[Product]`, `{{first_name}}` and `[CTA link]`. With no A/B data, an LLM judge scores the emails against onboarding best practices, over a set of varied new-user personas.

```json
{
  "seed_candidate": {
    "welcome_email": "Subject: Welcome\n\nThanks for signing up. Let us know if you have questions.\n"
  },
